* Generic analog models for explicitly generic symbols. These are not real part numbers.

.SUBCKT generic_opamp IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT
RINP IN+ 0 1G
RINM IN- 0 1G
EOUT OUT 0 IN+ IN- 100000
ROUT OUT 0 100
.ENDS

.SUBCKT generic_comparator IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT
RINP IN+ 0 1G
RINM IN- 0 1G
EOUT OUT V- IN+ IN- 1000000
ROUT OUT V- 100
.ENDS
